   {"issue": "'A purchase price ... which is not less than any of the following: (i) ... (ii) ... or (iii)' is ambiguous between a price at or above the highest of the three measures and a price at or above any one of them. The disjunctive 'any ... or' makes the pricing floor indeterminate.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.26}
